# PQ-BN direct drive: a flash write requested while the panel is still converging pauses the drive
# at the next phase boundary (pixels hold still), writes, and resumes (hal_display_pause) instead of
# waiting for every update to settle. Leaving the book right after a page turn saves the reading
# position while the turn and the home screen are being driven.
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 30%            # Field Notes on E-Ink, the first shelf row: the book 160dp opened on the old shelf (reader-one-1)
+3s      key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+200ms   key   home               # position saved while the panel is still driving
+3s      snap  home
+500ms   end
